{
  "schema_version": "argument_graph/0.1",
  "example_id": "persuade:95A6F680F078",
  "root": "u2",
  "units": [
    {
      "id": "u1",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 31,
      "text": "dear who ever this may concern,",
      "role": "unannotated",
      "stance": "unclear",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u2",
      "start": 32,
      "end": 101,
      "text": "i foundly belive that we should be able to keep the Electoral Collage",
      "role": "position",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u3",
      "start": 102,
      "end": 216,
      "text": "because it has haelped this far with fairness and making sure that all the votes have been counted at least twice.",
      "role": "claim",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u4",
      "start": 218,
      "end": 308,
      "text": "But i also see that from where you stand the Electral Collage may be just a waste of money",
      "role": "counterclaim",
      "stance": "conceded",
      "polarity": "negative"
    },
    {
      "id": "u5",
      "start": 309,
      "end": 340,
      "text": "and in some peoples eyes it is.",
      "role": "counterclaim",
      "stance": "conceded",
      "polarity": "negative"
    },
    {
      "id": "u6",
      "start": 341,
      "end": 381,
      "text": "but that doesnt mean that in alls it is.",
      "role": "rebuttal",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "negative"
    },
    {
      "id": "u7",
      "start": 382,
      "end": 402,
      "text": "from where is see it",
      "role": "claim",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u8",
      "start": 403,
      "end": 417,
      "text": "if it helps us",
      "role": "claim",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u9",
      "start": 418,
      "end": 434,
      "text": "why  not keep it",
      "role": "claim",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u10",
      "start": 435,
      "end": 477,
      "text": "even if it doesnt always pan out as planed",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "conceded",
      "polarity": "negative"
    },
    {
      "id": "u11",
      "start": 478,
      "end": 502,
      "text": "we all have our problems",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "conceded",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u12",
      "start": 503,
      "end": 557,
      "text": "but that doesnt mean that the government shuts us down",
      "role": "claim",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "negative"
    },
    {
      "id": "u13",
      "start": 558,
      "end": 668,
      "text": "it just means that the only reason we have those isssues are because not everything will go according to plan.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u14",
      "start": 670,
      "end": 711,
      "text": "it also doesnt mean let it get outta hand",
      "role": "claim",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "negative"
    },
    {
      "id": "u15",
      "start": 712,
      "end": 754,
      "text": "then try to real it in as soon as possible",
      "role": "claim",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u16",
      "start": 755,
      "end": 840,
      "text": "the only way this would work is if we had some one who didnt care who won eaither way",
      "role": "claim",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u17",
      "start": 841,
      "end": 869,
      "text": "so long as eveything is fair",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u18",
      "start": 870,
      "end": 890,
      "text": "and not messed with.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "negative"
    },
    {
      "id": "u19",
      "start": 891,
      "end": 953,
      "text": "so what im trying to get at is that we dont always get our way",
      "role": "claim",
      "stance": "conceded",
      "polarity": "negative"
    },
    {
      "id": "u20",
      "start": 954,
      "end": 1018,
      "text": "but that doesnt mean we need to shut down the Electoral Collage.",
      "role": "concluding_summary",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "negative"
    },
    {
      "id": "u21",
      "start": 1019,
      "end": 1097,
      "text": "According to the 23 amendment the district of columbia is allocated 3 electors",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "reported",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u22",
      "start": 1098,
      "end": 1156,
      "text": "and treated like a state for puposes of Electoral Collage.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "reported",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u23",
      "start": 1157,
      "end": 1239,
      "text": "also Richard nixion and Jimmy Carter Bob Dole have agreed on the electoral collage",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "reported",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u24",
      "start": 1240,
      "end": 1260,
      "text": "and there not alone.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "negative"
    },
    {
      "id": "u25",
      "start": 1262,
      "end": 1286,
      "text": "thank you for your time,",
      "role": "unannotated",
      "stance": "unclear",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u26",
      "start": 1288,
      "end": 1299,
      "text": "PROPER_NAME",
      "role": "unannotated",
      "stance": "unclear",
      "polarity": "positive"
    }
  ],
